### =====================================================================
### Feriaza API v1: pruebas manuales con la extensión REST Client de VS Code
### Hacé clic en "Send Request" arriba de cada pedido, en orden.
### Los tokens del login se guardan solos y los usan los pedidos siguientes.
### =====================================================================

@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1
@emailNuevo = api5@feriaza.test

### 1. Listar categorías (público) → 200
GET {{base}}/categorias
Accept: application/json

### 2. Registro de feriante → 201 con token (cambiá @emailNuevo para repetirlo)
POST {{base}}/feriantes/registro
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Ana",
  "apellido": "Prueba",
  "email": "{{emailNuevo}}",
  "password": "Prueba123",
  "password_confirmation": "Prueba123",
  "telefono": "3644000001",
  "categoria_id": 1
}

### 3. Registro con el mismo email → 422
POST {{base}}/feriantes/registro
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Ana",
  "apellido": "Prueba",
  "email": "{{emailNuevo}}",
  "password": "Prueba123",
  "password_confirmation": "Prueba123",
  "telefono": "3644000001",
  "categoria_id": 1
}

### 4. Registro con contraseña corta → 422
POST {{base}}/feriantes/registro
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Ana",
  "apellido": "Prueba",
  "email": "corta@feriaza.test",
  "password": "123",
  "password_confirmation": "123",
  "telefono": "3644000001",
  "categoria_id": 1
}

### 5. Login feriante → 200 con token
# @name loginFeriante
POST {{base}}/feriantes/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "feriante@feriaza.test",
  "password": "Feriante123"
}

### 6. Login con contraseña incorrecta → 422
POST {{base}}/feriantes/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "feriante@feriaza.test",
  "password": "incorrecta"
}

### 7. Login coordinador → 200 con token
# @name loginCoordinador
POST {{base}}/coordinador/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "coordinador@feriaza.test",
  "password": "Coordinador123"
}

### 8. Ver mi cuenta (token de feriante) → 200
GET {{base}}/mi-cuenta
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginFeriante.response.body.token}}

### 9. Modificar mi cuenta → 200
PATCH {{base}}/mi-cuenta
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginFeriante.response.body.token}}

{
  "telefono": "3644999999",
  "instagram": "@feriaza"
}

### 10. Mi cuenta sin token → 401
GET {{base}}/mi-cuenta
Accept: application/json

### 11. Mi cuenta con token de coordinador → 403
GET {{base}}/mi-cuenta
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCoordinador.response.body.token}}

### 12. Logout feriante → 200
POST {{base}}/logout
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginFeriante.response.body.token}}

### 13. Token ya revocado → 401
GET {{base}}/mi-cuenta
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginFeriante.response.body.token}}

### 14. Logout coordinador → 200
POST {{base}}/logout
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCoordinador.response.body.token}}
